tempo 90
section one 4 bars {
  deck A: kick x ~ x ~
  before two 2 bars: master: reverb 0 -> 0.4 over 2 bars
}
section two 4 bars {
  deck A: kick x x x x | bass c2 ~ c2 ~
}
arrange one two
loop

